{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3057\u3093\u3054\u3046\u306f\u3000\u3042\u304b \u3042\u304a \u3088\u304f\u307f\u3066\u3000<i>\u30b3\u30ef\u30b7</i>\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Look carefully at the red and blue signals, and <i>DESTROY </i>them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an eccentric action puzzle game where you destroy blocks modeled after pedestrian traffic lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/howtoplay_1_anime.gif?t=1744201267\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Signal blocks&quot; will appear on the board. They can be moved vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Vertical blocks can only be moved vertically, and horizontal blocks can only be moved horizontally.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/howtoplay_2_anime.gif?t=1744201267\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When two or more signals of the same color touch each other, the blocks will explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Signal blocks in contact to the explosion will change their color due to the shock. When this creates matching colors in sequence, it forms a chain and will continue exploding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playable modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ENDLESS : Earn score until game over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STAGE : Destroy a targeted number of blocks on the board of various shapes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TIME LIMIT : Reach hi-score within the time by chain destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCORE RACE : Compete by the time taken to earn a target score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BATTLE : Can compete offline with one PC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mode has EASY, NORMAL, and HARD courses, so you can play at a difficulty level that matches your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroying traffic lights in real life is prohibited by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506550?t=1744201267","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3506550?t=1744201267","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/a8a15f425393d31426a825432a1a59f716c9c22e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744201267","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/a8a15f425393d31426a825432a1a59f716c9c22e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744201267","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u3057\u3093\u3054\u3046\u306f\u3000\u3042\u304b \u3042\u304a \u3088\u304f\u307f\u3066\u3000<i>\u30b3\u30ef\u30b7</i>\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Look carefully at the red and blue signals, and <i>DESTROY </i>them)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's an eccentric action puzzle game where you destroy blocks modeled after pedestrian traffic lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Basic rules</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/howtoplay_1_anime.gif?t=1744201267\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Signal blocks&quot; will appear on the board. They can be moved vertically or horizontally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Vertical blocks can only be moved vertically, and horizontal blocks can only be moved horizontally.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/extras/howtoplay_2_anime.gif?t=1744201267\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When two or more signals of the same color touch each other, the blocks will explode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Signal blocks in contact to the explosion will change their color due to the shock. When this creates matching colors in sequence, it forms a chain and will continue exploding.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Playable modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ENDLESS : Earn score until game over.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STAGE : Destroy a targeted number of blocks on the board of various shapes.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">TIME LIMIT : Reach hi-score within the time by chain destruction.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SCORE RACE : Compete by the time taken to earn a target score.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">BATTLE : Can compete offline with one PC.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mode has EASY, NORMAL, and HARD courses, so you can play at a difficulty level that matches your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a work of fiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroying traffic lights in real life is prohibited by law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["NEO\u30bf\u30b1\u30c8\u30f3\u30dc"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3506550/header.jpg?t=1744201267","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096739,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096739/movie480.mp4?t=1739964809","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096739/movie_max.mp4?t=1739964809"},"name":"SINGOU BREAKA play movie","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096739/cedb2f276041684a79b058a5c7a7688e4a06ecb4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739964809","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096739/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739964809","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096739/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739964809"}}],"name":"\u30b7\u30f3\u30b4\u30a6\u30d6\u30ec\u30a4\u30ab SINGOU BREAKA","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["NEO\u30bf\u30b1\u30c8\u30f3\u30dc"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"